WEBVTT - Tears of Steel (English Subtitles)

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000
[Low mechanical hum of the central particle accelerator]

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Amsterdam. A dystopian future overrun by rogue cyborgs.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Thom calibrates the temporal memory projector.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Celia: "Do you really think she's going to listen to you now?"

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Thom: "She has to. This is the only chance we have left."

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:51.000
[Energy levels surging to ninety-eight percent]

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:01.000
A giant mechanical robot approaches the sanctuary perimeter!

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:12.000
"Initiate the recall sequence! Now!"
